GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 625(4)(a) the company commits an offence` MEANS
    CONSIDER `default is made in complying with this section`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If default is made in complying with this section, an offence is committed by"
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): whether default is made is not yet known

-- src:8398 | (4) If default is made in complying with this section, an offence is committed by—
-- src:8399 | (a) the company, and
-- src:8400 | (b) every officer of the company who is in default.
@ref s 625(4) Notice to registrar of redenomination: the officer (src:8398-8400)
GIVEN `default is made in complying with this section` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 1121 the officer is in default` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 625(4)(b) the officer commits an offence` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `default is made in complying with this section` EQUALS JUST FALSE
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If default is made in complying with this section, an offence is committed by"
        IF `s 1121 the officer is in default` EQUALS JUST FALSE
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "every officer of the company who is in default" (the officer is not in default, as s 1121 answers)
        IF `default is made in complying with this section` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `s 1121 the officer is in default` EQUALS JUST TRUE
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether default is made, or whether the officer is in default (s 1121, coa24), is not known


-- src:8401 | (5) A person guilty of an offence under this section is liable on summary conviction to a fine not exceeding level 3 on the standard scale and, for continued contravention, a daily default fine not exceeding one-tenth of level 3 on the standard scale.
@ref s 625(5) Notice to registrar of redenomination: the penalty (src:8401)
GIVEN `the person is guilty of an offence under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`s 625(5) the penalty for a person guilty of an offence under this section` MEANS
    IF `the person is guilty of an offence under this section`
    THEN JUST (Penalty WITH
            `how convicted` IS `on summary conviction`
            `imprisonment not exceeding` IS NOTHING
            `fine not exceeding` IS JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 1)
            `daily default fine for continued contravention` IS JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 0.1)
            `imprisonment and fine together` IS FALSE)
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the liability is that of "A person guilty of an offence under this section"


§§ `s 626 Reduction of capital in connection with redenomination`

-- src:8403 | (1) A limited company that passes a resolution redenominating some or all of its shares may, for the purpose of adjusting the nominal values of the redenominated shares to obtain values that are, in the opinion of the company, more suitable, reduce its share capital under this section.
@ref s 626(1) Reduction of capital in connection with redenomination (src:8403)
GIVEN `the company is a limited company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it has passed a resolution redenominating some or all of its shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the reduction is for the purpose of adjusting the nominal values of the redenominated shares to values that are, in the opinion of the company, more suitable` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 626(1) the company may reduce its share capital under this section` MEANS
    IF       `the company is a limited company`
         AND `it has passed a resolution redenominating some or all of its shares`
         AND `the reduction is for the purpose of adjusting the nominal values of the redenominated shares to values that are, in the opinion of the company, more suitable`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is that of "A limited company that passes a resolution redenominating some or all of its shares" and is "for the purpose of adjusting the nominal values"

-- src:8404 | (2) A reduction of capital under this section requires a special resolution of the company.
@ref s 626(2) Reduction of capital in connection with redenomination: a special resolution (src:8404)
GIVEN `s 283 the resolution is a special resolution` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
