    CONSIDER `s 283 the resolution is a special resolution`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A reduction of capital under this section requires a special resolution of the company" (it has one: fork F-except-met)
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST TRUE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A reduction of capital under this section requires a special resolution of the company"
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the resolution is a special resolution is s 283 (coa7)

-- "within three months of the resolution effecting the redenomination": read as the three months AFTER it (fork F-three-months).
-- src:8405 | (3) Any such resolution must be passed within three months of the resolution effecting the redenomination.
@ref s 626(3) Reduction of capital in connection with redenomination: within three months (src:8405)
GIVEN `the day the redenomination resolution was passed` IS A DATE
      `the day the reduction resolution was passed` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 626(3) the reduction resolution was passed in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the day the reduction resolution was passed` LESS THAN `the day the redenomination resolution was passed`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): "within three months of" does not say whether the three months look back as well as forward (fork F-three-months)
        IF `the day the reduction resolution was passed` AT MOST (`add months` `the day the redenomination resolution was passed` 3)
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Any such resolution must be passed within three months of the resolution effecting the redenomination"

-- "must not exceed 10% of the nominal value of the company's allotted share capital immediately after the reduction"
