`s 626(4) the amount of the reduction is within the limit` MEANS
    IF `the amount by which the share capital is reduced` TIMES 100 AT MOST 10 TIMES `the nominal value of the company's allotted share capital immediately after the reduction`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must not exceed 10% of the nominal value of the company's allotted share capital immediately after the reduction"

